<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Two die in Deelkraal mine, output continues.</title>
<headline>Two die in Deelkraal mine, output continues.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two miners died in a rockblast at Deelkraal Gold Mining Co Ltd just before midnight on Tuesday, a spokesman for manager Gold Fields South Africa said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Production was unaffected by the seismic event which occurred 2,750 metres below the surface in the No.1 sub shaft.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
